1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Kevlar verifies changing web data before it reaches production systems.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Custom Bright Data collectors acquire governed public pricing, catalog, and changelog sources.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Deterministic mappings resolve observations into canonical entities with field-level provenance.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
The Convex backend preserves append-only bitemporal history, corrections, and last-known-good facts.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Only verified fact changes become semantic events.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Disagreement opens an explicit conflict instead of silently averaging values.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Next.js on Vercel exposes REST, signed webhooks, a TypeScript SDK, and read-only MCP.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
AI sees only released events and proposes changes; it never approves them.

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Operations track freshness, delivery, provider health, costs, backups, and alerts.

10
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,840
Our controlled benchmark passed twenty-four of twenty-four checks with zero false releases.

